   "value": "<p><em>Fa Jin — Cursed Technique Reversal, 6th level</em></p><p>At 6th level, as an action for 6 CE you can create a 60 feet line while wielding a slashing or piercing weapon or a 30 feet cone while wielding a bludgeoning weapon or unarmed strike. All creatures in range must make a CE saving throw. On a failure, they take 6d8 necrotic damage and gain 3 negative Jin charges. You gain 3 Jin charges for every creature that fails its save against your technique.</p>",
